e in a cold condition. The main purpose of cold functional tests is to verify the leak-tightness of the primary circuit and components - such as pressure vessels, pipelines and valves of both the nuclear and conventional islands - and to clean the main circulation pipes. The tests mark the first time the reactor systems are operated together with the auxiliary systems.\nOnce fully operational, the four units of the Haiyang plant will generate 40 billion kilowatt-hours of electricity annually, enough to meet the electricity needs of half of Shandong Province's residents, SPIC said. It noted that the site is planned to have six 1,000-megawatt reactors, with space reserved for two future expansions, \"making it a 10-megawatt-class nuclear power base\".",
