        "title": "Mini book: Architecture as a Socio-Technical Craft",
        "link": "https://www.infoq.com/minibooks/architect-sociotechnical-craft/?utm_campaign=infoq_content&utm_source=infoq&utm_medium=feed&utm_term=global",
