        "full_content": "I still remember my first pair of Ray-Bans: the Original Wayfarer Classics with polished black frames and green lenses. Then, in middle school, when Aviators were all the rage, I convinced my mom to buy me a pair with gold metal frames and orange flash polarized lenses. Looking back, they were a bold choice for a 13-year-old girl, but I wore them everywhere. By my freshman year of college, I saved up for a pair of Round Metal sunglasses with rose gold frames and blue gradient lenses. They were the first sunglasses I ever bought with my own money, and more than a decade later, I still have them. Mind you, the lenses are covered in scratches, but I can’t bring myself to part with them.\nFor many people, Ray-Bans are the first sunglasses they ever owned, or the pair they keep coming back to. They’re the reliable classics that have stood the test of time, aging gracefully while staying relevant across generations. From kids and teens to adults, Ray-Bans have a universal appeal, offering iconic designs and quality at a more approachable price point than many luxury eyewear brands.\nAnd Ray-Ban isn’t just coasting on its heritage. With the introduction of Ray-Ban Meta AI glasses, the company has helped redefine what smart eyewear can look like, blending advanced technology with a design that feels stylish rather than purely functional. At WIRED, we’re fans of the brand’s ability to balance timeless style with innovation. If you’re in the market for a new pair of sunnies, Ray-Ban remains one of our top recommendations. To help you save, I’ve rounded up the best Ray-Ban coupons, discounts, and deals currently available.\nScore a Ray-Ban Coupon Code for 40% Off Meta Glasses\nFor a limited time, Ray-Ban is offering 40% off prescription lenses, AI glasses included. The Ray-Ban Meta glasses offer hands-free capabilities for taking photos and videos, listening to music, making calls, live translation, and accessing AI assistance, all while maintaining the brand’s classic aesthetic. This new generation features an upgraded camera, longer battery life, and familiar frame designs, making them the most user-friendly smart glasses we've tested. However, there are some trade-offs. The higher price point, dependence on Meta’s AI ecosystem, and ongoing privacy concerns regarding camera-equipped wearables may cause some consumers to hesitate. That said, if you want smart glasses that you can comfortably wear every day, these are it.\nUnlock the Best Ray-Ban Coupon for 10% Off All Glasses\nRefer a friend to Ray-Ban, and you’ll both receive 10% off your next online purchase after they sign up. The discount also applies to Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses, though standard exclusions may apply.\nSave More With a Ray-Ban Promo Code on Your Prescription Sunglasses\nFor a limited time, Ray-Ban is offering up to 40% off prescription sunglasses. This discount applies to several iconic styles, including the Original Wayfarer Classic, Clubmaster Classic, and Round Metal, among others. Special edition models are also included in this Ray-Ban promotion, such as the Bill 4th of July and designs from the A$AP Rocky collaboration.\nUse this Ray-Ban Student Discount for 20% Off\nEligible students who verify their status through UNiDAYS can save 20% on Ray-Ban online orders. While the discount typically applies sitewide, standard exclusions may apply, so it’s worth checking the terms and conditions before you shop. Keep in mind that this offer can change; Ray-Ban has previously increased the student discount to 25%, so it’s also worth checking back for a better deal before making a purchase.\nHow to Get a Ray-Ban Online Coupon Code for Maximum Savings\nThe first place I check before buying Ray-Bans is the clearance section. You can often save up to 50% on select styles, from aviators and wayfarers to polarized and transition lenses. You probably won’t find Meta smart glasses discounted here anytime soon, but you will likely score some classic frames for significantly less. Inventory changes frequently, so if you spot a pair you like, grab it before they sell out. Standard return and warranty policies still apply.\nGet 50% Off Ray-Ban Sunglasses\nShopping the online clearance section at Ray-Ban is one of the best ways to save majorly with this highly-regarded, but sometimes expensive brand. There are glasses for 30 or 50% off, and you can browse by popularity, release time, and price, with styles like the original wayfarer and old-school style Teru Bio-based for half-off.\nEye-Conic Style: The Dolce & Gabbana x Ray-Ban Drop Is Here\nTwo iconic brands are teaming up for an unforgettable collab. Dolce&Gabbana x Ray-Ban have a brand-new partnership worth splurging on. Using Ray-Ban’s signature style and shape, with Dolce&Gabbana’s fun, playful colors that push the boundaries, there are two brand-new eye-catching styles. THE SHOOTER and THE OUTDOORSMAN by Dolce&Gabbana x Ray-Ban are the two newest drops in the collab that push the envelope with a stylish frame and bright lenses.",
