h Zoro promo code LIGHTING26. These discounts can be applied to electrical supplies like fuses and wiring devices, lighting like light bulbs and batteries, and top brands such as Hubbell and 3M.\nUnlock 15% Off Everyday Zoro Essentials\nAs previously mentioned, I really like that Zoro offers rotating deals, making it easier to get what you need on discount—if what you were looking for isn’t on sale this week, it’s likely that it will be discounted next week. Stock up on the supplies and essentials your small business needs to thrive for less this month, with offers for up to 15% off essentials. This means huge discounts on food and beverage supplies, storage solutions, cleaning supplies like trash cans and cleaning products, and more. Although these are smaller priced items, when buying in bulk they can add up, so be sure to capitalize on this sale and use Zoro promo code ESSENTIALS9726 at check out to save.\n15% Off Zoro Storage Solutions\nChances are, your small biz could use a bit of extra help with organization and storage, be sure to use Zoro coupon code STORAGE8296 for 15% off storage solutions, until August 23.\nCheck Zoro Weekly Deals for 55% Off\nLike I said, keep an eye on Zoro’s Weekly Deals page for rotating deals on virtually everything in Zoro’s expansive stock, for up to 55% off. If you don’t see what you’re looking for this week, check back after because the deals are always shifting. Right now, you can get $10 off $50 or $40 off purchases of $175 with adhesive products and tape, with Zoro promo code ADHESIVES726. This week’s weekly deals include savings on tape, concrete, asphalt, caulk guns, and more.\nEnjoy Free Shipping With This Zoro Coupon\nIf you’re going to be shopping for supplies to keep your small business running, be sure to make an account. It’s free and easy to do, and once you’re signed in, you’ll get perks on orders like free shipping on orders over $50, no Zoro coupon needed!\nScore a 10% Zoro Promo Code Just for Signing Up\nAs mentioned previously, be sure to sign up for a Zoro account to get points, track orders, make returns, get free shipping, and more perks. Plus, when you sign up to get Zoro newsletters, not only will you get access to savings, weekly deals spotlights, and more, you’ll also get a Zoro promo code for 10% off your next purchase when you sign up for Zoro emails.",
