        "image": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/5kNkNMV9q7yhfhQL26vFLK-2048-80.jpg",
        "full_content": "I'm ranking the best Google Pixel 11 and Pixel 11 Pro deals at launch — free phones, trade-in discounts, and more\nThe wait is over.\nGoogle's latest flagship lineup has finally hit store shelves, and I'm hard at work tracking down the best Pixel 11 deals (and Pixel 11 Pro deals) so you don't have to go searching. Whether you're interested in the base model Pixel 11, the powerful Pixel 11 Pro, or the super-sized Pixel 11 Pro XL, there are already quite a few deals and leftover preorder promotions that could make these AI-powered flagships pretty cheap (or even free) if you play your cards right.\nThe new generation of Pixel phones takes the stellar foundation of the Google Pixel 10 series and adds a new processor, an upgraded camera system, and a set of stylish new color variants. The Pixel 11 Pro and 11 Pro XL also feature the new HiLight LED system, a fancy light array around the camera bar that's sure to turn heads.\nAnother bit of good news is that, other than the Pixel 11 Pro XL (which now starts at $1,299), Google's 2026 lineup wasn't hit with a price increase this year. Still, the phones aren't exactly cheap, which is why the following deals are so important. Whether you're looking for a trade-in opportunity or a free gift card, keep reading for all of the best Pixel 11 discounts on the web (so far).\nQuick links\n- Google Pixel 11 hands-on review\n- Google Pixel 11 Pro official review\n- The best Google Pixel 11 Pro Fold deals\n- T-Mobile: FREE Pixel 11, Pixel 11 Pro with eligible line\n- Verizon: FREE Pixel 11 with eligible line\n- AT&T: FREE Pixel 11 phones with trade-in, new line\n- Amazon: free gift cards worth up to $200\n- Best Buy: free gift cards worth up to $200\n- Google Store: up to $600 off with trade-in\n- Xfinity Mobile: FREE Pixel 11 with trade-in, new line\nGoogle Pixel 11 deals\nT-Mobile: Get a FREE Google Pixel 11 with new line on most plans\nYou read that right: the Pixel 11 was literally just announced, but you can already get the base model flagship for free by adding a line with most plans on T-Mobile's website. That includes the carrier's affordable Essentials 2.0 tier!\nRead moreRead less▼\nVerizon: Get a FREE Google Pixel 11 with eligible line\nAdd a line with the Unlimited Welcome, Unlimited Plus, or Unlimited Ultimate plan and Verizon will give you enough promo credits over 36 months to make the new Google Pixel 11 completely free! There's also some trade-in credit available.\nRead moreRead less▼\nAT&T: Get the Pixel 11 for only $5.43 per month with new line\nAdd a line with an eligible data plan and AT&T will knock the price of the Google Pixel 11 down to only $5.43 per month for 36 months. No trade-in required!\nRead moreRead less▼\nAmazon: Get a free $100 gift card with Google Pixel 11\nOrder the base model Google Pixel 11 unlocked from Amazon and you'll get a free $100 gift card with your purchase, no strings attached! There's also some trade-in credit up for grabs (in the form of an additional gift card).\nRead moreRead less▼\nBest Buy: Get a free $100 gift card with Pixel 11\nJust like Amazon, if you order the Google Pixel 11 unlocked from Best Buy you'll receive a free $100 gift card to spend on anything you want. There's also some trade-in credit available.\nRead moreRead less▼\nGoogle Store: Get up to $500 off with eligible trade-in\nBuy the Google Pixel 11 directly from the source and you'll be eligible for up to $500 of trade-in credit. You'll also get six months of Google AI Pro for free (a $119 value).\nRead moreRead less▼\nXfinity Mobile: Get a FREE Pixel 11 with trade-in, new line\nAdd a line with the Mobile Plus plan and trade in an eligible device and Xfinity Mobile will give you $899 in promo credits, effectively making the Google Pixel 11 free. Don't have anything to trade in? Skip that part of the process and you'll still score a $600 discount.\nRead moreRead less▼\nGoogle Pixel 11 Pro deals\nT-Mobile: Get a FREE Google Pixel 11 Pro with eligible trade-in, new line\nProcess a trade-in and add a new line on the Experience More plan (or higher) and T-Mobile will hook you up with a FREE Pixel 11 Pro. The carrier is being pretty generous with the devices it accepts, so dig up those old phones and see how much you can save.\nRead moreRead less▼\nVerizon: Get a FREE Google Pixel 11 Pro with new line\nVerizon is running a deal that will give you $1,100 in promo credits when you add a line with the Unlimited Plus or Unlimited Ultimate plans. That's enough to make the Pixel 11 Pro totally free!\nVerizon is also really pushing its Simplicity plan right now: bundle the new wireless plan with the Pixel 11 Pro and you'll get both for as little as $45 per month.\nRead moreRead less▼\nAT&T: Get a FREE Pixel 11 Pro with trade-in, new line\nProcess an eligible trade-in and add a line with a qualified unlimited plan and AT&T will give you enough promo credits to make the powerful Google Pixel 11 Pro completely free!\nRead moreRead less▼\nAmazon: Get a $200 gift card with Pixel 11 Pro\nPurchase the Pixel 11 Pro unlocked from Amazon and you'll get a free $200 gift card with your purchase.\nRead moreRead less▼\nBest Buy: Get a free $200 gift card with Pixel 11 Pro\nBuy the Pixel 11 Pro unlocked from Best Buy and you'll get a free $200 gift card with your purchase, no strings attached. You can also claim up to $1,000 of trade-in credit when you send the retailer an old or broken phone.\nRead moreRead less▼\nGoogle Store: Get up to $600 of trade-in credit\nOrder the Pixel 11 Pro from the Google Store and you'll score up to $600 off when you trade in an eligible device. You'll also get a free six-month subscription to Google AI Pro.\nRead moreRead less▼\nXfinity Mobile: Get a FREE Pixel 11 Pro with trade-in, new line\nJust like the base model Pixel 11, you can add a line with the Mobile Plus plan and score a FREE Pixel 11 Pro when you trade in an old or broken device at Xfinity Mobile. There's also a $600 discount available if you skip the trade-in process.\nRead moreRead less▼\nGoogle Pixel 11 Pro XL deals\nT-Mobile: Get a FREE Google Pixel 11 Pro XL with trade-in and Experience Beyond plan\nProcess a trade-in and add a new line with the Experience Beyond plan and T-Mobile will give you enough promo credits to make the Pixel 11 Pro XL completely free! Go with the cheaper Experience More plan and you'll be eligible for up to $1,100 of trade-in credit.\nRead moreRead less▼\nVerizon: Score up to $1,100 off the Pixel 11 Pro XL with new line\nAdd a line with the Unlimited Ultimate plan and Verizon will give you the Pixel 11 Pro XL for just $5 per month. No trade-in required!\nRead moreRead less▼\nAT&T: Get a FREE Pixel 11 Pro XL with eligible trade-in, new line\nAdd a line with an eligible data plan and AT&T will hook you up with a FREE Pixel 11 Pro XL when you trade in an old or broken device with a value of $200 or higher.\nRead moreRead less▼\nAmazon: Get a free $200 gift card with Pixel 11 Pro XL\nJust like the regular Pixel 11 Pro, you'll get a free $200 Amazon gift card when you order the XL phone on the retailer's website.\nRead moreRead less▼\nBest Buy: Get a free $200 gift card with Pixel 11 Pro XL\nYou guessed it: Best Buy will also give you a free $200 gift card when you order the unlocked Pixel 11 Pro XL on its website.\nRead moreRead less▼\nGoogle Store: Get up to $600 off with trade-in\nHead to the Google Store and purchase the Pixel 11 Pro XL and you'll be eligible for up to $600 off the phone when you trade in.\nRead moreRead less▼\nXfinity Mobile: Get a FREE Pixel 11 Pro with trade-in, new line\nThat's right: the affordable carrier Xfinity Mobile will give you the Pixel 11 Pro XL for FREE when you add a line with the Mobile Plus plan and trade in an eligible device. That's $1,300 in savings!\nRead moreRead less▼\nFAQ\nHow much does the Google Pixel 11 series cost?\nThe base model Google Pixel 11 is set to retail for $899 / €999, while the Pixel 11 Pro and Pixel 11 Pro XL will cost