        "title": "Early Xreal Aura hype tops expectations, CEO Chi Xu says its demand is 'exciting'",
        "link": "https://www.androidcentral.com/gaming/virtual-reality/early-xreal-aura-hype-tops-expectations-ceo-chi-xu-says-its-demand-is-exciting",
