        "full_content": "TCL just launched a huge Back to School sale on NXTPAPER tablets and smartphones — here are the deals you should consider\nTCL's lineup of eye-friendly devices is getting hefty price cuts at Amazon.\nTL;DR: Amazon has launched a bunch of deals on TCL's eye-friendly smartphones and tablets, just in time for Back to School 2026.\nConsidering how much time we spend staring at screens throughout the day, it's no wonder that many folks are concerned about their eye health. Some brands would pack the latest eye-friendly display technology into their most expensive devices, but not TCL.\nThe company's NXTPAPER lineup is full of fast and feature-packed smartphones and tablets that are built with your vision in mind, and they're often way cheaper than the competition. These devices boast cutting-edge 120Hz displays with customizable settings, anti-reflective finishes, and up to 61% less blue light than traditional screens.\nWhether you're shopping for an eye-friendly Android phone or a versatile tablet to take with you to class, Amazon's Back to School sale is slashing prices on a bunch of our favorite TCL NXTPAPER devices. Keep reading for all of my top picks today.\nEditor's pick - best smartphone\nTCL NXTPAPER 70 Pro 128GB: $329.99 $279.98 at Amazon\nCurrently 15% off at Amazon, the TCL NXTPAPER 70 Pro is an impressive budget device with an incredible eye-friendly display, solid performance, and a large 5,200mAh battery. You also get a few specs that you may not expect, such as an IP68 rating and a microSD slot for expandable storage.\nEditor's pick - best tablet\nTCL NXTPAPER 11 Plus 256GB: $369.99 $239.99 at Amazon\nThe versatile TCL NXTPAPER 11 Plus boasts multiple eye-friendly display modes, a powerful MediaTek processor, and a hefty 8,000mAh battery that's sure to last a full day on a single charge. Grab the slab from Amazon during its Back to School sale and you'll score a straight 35% off your purchase.\nMore TCL NXTPAPER deals today\nGet t