        "image": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/FU3MpjwcwWSdwzEXkC5Vzm-2048-80.jpg",
        "full_content": "Mint Mobile will basically give you a FREE year of wireless when you buy the Google Pixel 11 — here's how it works\nOne of the best Pixel 11 deals I've seen yet.\nMint Mobile has finally announced its Google Pixel 11 deals, and they're no joke. Bundle the purchase of the base model Pixel 11 with one year of the Unlimited plan, for instance, and you'll get $275 off the phone AND 50% off the wireless.\nIn other words, you're getting a full 12 months of T-Mobile-powered mobile coverage and a brand new flagship phone for just $804 (or $67 per month when you use affirm).\nConsidering that the retail cost of the Google Pixel 11 starts at $899, you're essentially getting a full year of unlimited talk, text, and data for free with the purchase of the phone.\nAs far as carrier deals are concerned, this might be the best Google Pixel 11 deal I've seen yet. Sure, it's a mouthful, but if you were looking for a way to get a cheap new wireless plan and a new smartphone in one fell swoop, it's pretty unmatched.\nGoogle Pixel 11 256GB: $899 $624, plus 50% off one year of Unlimited at Mint Mobile\nBundle your purchase of the new Google Pixel 11 with one year of Mint Mobile's Unlimited plan and it'll only cost you $804 out the door. That's cheaper than simply buying the phone unlocked, plus can you imagine the pure thrill that comes from not paying your phone bill again until 2027?\nThe Google Pixel 11 takes the stellar foundation of its predecessor, the Pixel 10, and adds a new processor, faster wireless charging, and an upgraded camera system. You also get Android 17 straight out of the box, in addition to the standard features you'd expect in a Pixel phone, such as a vibrant AMOLED display and seven years of OS/security upgrades guaranteed.\nMint Mobile, for its part, is an approachable MVNO carrier owned and operated by T-Mobile. It utilizes a unique buy-in-bulk plan system that lets you purchase wireless in 3, 6, and 12-month increments of time. The annual Unlimited plan, which is easily the best value, gives you 12 months of unlimited talk, text, and data on T-Mo's vast 5G network, plus you'll get a free mobile hotspot and calls to Mexico, Canada, and the UK at no additional cost.\nSure, you miss out on some of the premium perks offered by more-expensive unlimited plans, but if you just want cheap and straightforward wireless coverage, Mint Mobile is one of the best providers around. The Pixel 11 deal above is only available for new customers, but if you've been looking for a good time to switch phone plans, this might be it.\nGet the latest news from Android Central, your trusted companion in the world of Android\nAfter almost a decade of working in the e-commerce space, Patrick Farmer (he/him) began his career at Android Central as a Deals and Commerce Writer before moving into a new role as AC's eCommerce Editor in 2023. When he's not hunting down the best deals and offering shopping advice for our readers, you'll often find him listening to music, camping out at a brewery, or treating his cat like a human child.\nYou must confirm your public display name before commenting\nPlease logout and then login again, you will then be prompted to enter your display name.",
