        "title": "Trump declares economic warfare on Iran. And, SCOTUS to rule on White House ballroom",
        "link": "https://www.npr.org/2026/08/21/g-s1-139542/up-first-newsletter-trump-iran-economy-white-house-ballroom-bond-market",
