        "full_content": "Business News›News›India›‘Strong India alone can give stability to the world’: PM Narendra Modi at ET WLF 2026 | Full speech \n‘Strong India alone can give stability to the world’: PM Narendra Modi at ET WLF 2026 | Full speech\nAt ET World Leaders Forum 2026, Prime Minister Narendra Modi outlined how India’s reform journey is reshaping the country’s economy, infrastructure, ease of doing business and ease of living. From PLI and the Jan Vishwas Bill to decriminalising offences, banking reforms and faster project execution, PM Modi highlighted how policy changes are translating into visible outcomes on the ground. He spoke about India emerging as a symbol of growth and hope for the world. PM Modi also highlighted everyday transformations such as affordable data, rapid 5G rollout, arguing that the real measure of governance is whether people can see and experience change in their daily lives.\n Show more\n- 06:42\n- 29:45\n- 25:17\n- 01:39\n- 04:31\n- 06:47\n- 05:09\n- 05:29\n- 04:25\n- 04:57\n- 04:49\n- 01:40\n- 02:29\n- 08:10\n- 04:19\n- 06:24\n- 08:10\n- 03:02\n- 04:40\n- 10:47\n- 06:19\n- 11:28\n- 03:29\n- 01:38\n- 09:01\n- 13:13\n- 01:17\n- 02:10\n- 03:00\n- 05:32\n- 02:16\n- 09:47\n- 07:00",
