        "title": "'BJP is afraid of CJP': Abhijeet Dipke breaks silence on alleged attack on Ashutosh in Jaipur",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-bjp-is-afraid-of-cjp-abhijeet-dipke-breaks-silence-on-alleged-attack-on-ashutosh-in-jaipur-3218969",
        "source": "India News",
