        "title": "Love, Betrayal, Murder: Gangster stabbed to death by close friend over lover in Nagpur",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-love-betrayal-murder-gangster-stabbed-to-death-by-close-friend-over-lover-in-nagpur-3218975",
