        "title": "Reservation Hatao Andolan: Crowd swells at Delhi's Jantar Mantar, demands roll back of UGC rules",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-reservation-hatao-andolan-crowd-swells-at-delhi-s-jantar-mantar-demands-roll-back-of-ugc-rules-3218979",
