        "title": "Delhi Police registers FIR over student's pellet gun injury after Rahul Gandhi's protest",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-delhi-police-registers-fir-over-student-pellet-gun-injury-after-congress-leader-rahul-gandhi-protest-3218990",
