        "title": "India slams USCIRF over remarks on RSS: 'Should ignore such institutions'",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-india-slams-uscirf-over-remarks-on-rss-should-ignore-such-institutions-rashtriya-swayamsevak-sangh-3219000",
