        "title": "Delhi Police, central forces deployed at Jantar Mantar amid anti-reservation protest",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-delhi-police-and-central-forces-deployed-at-jantar-mantar-amid-anti-caste-reservation-protest-3219001",
