        "title": "Cockroach Janta Party team assaulted at Jaipur school, alleges BJP sent goons",
        "link": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095177/cockroach-janta-party-alleges-bjp-sent-goons-to-assault-its-team-visiting-jaipur-school?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
