        "title": "Jharkhand protest: Scuffle breaks out between students, police over burning Hemant Soren's effigy",
        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jharkhand-protest-scuffle-breaks-out-between-students-police-over-burning-hemant-sorens-effigy/articleshow/133407327.cms",
