        "title": "Uttarakhand CM felicitates Lakhpati Didis and women entrepreneurs at Chief Minister’s Udyamshala Chaupal 2026",
        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/uttarakhand-cm-felicitates-lakhpati-didis-and-women-entrepreneurs-at-chief-ministers-udyamshala-chaupal-2026/articleshow/133408808.cms",
        "source": "India News | Latest India News Today & Real-time News from India, India Breaking News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:51:27.473738+00:00",
