        "title": "BT India@100: ‘India has not lost the AI race,’ says Amitabh Kant, highlights the country’s biggest advantage",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/india-at-100/story/bt-india100-india-has-not-lost-the-ai-race-says-amitabh-kant-highlights-the-countrys-biggest-advantage-550567-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
