        "full_content": "Machine-washable rugs have become almost synonymous with Ruggable. Plenty of brands now offer washable options, but Ruggable was really the company that popularized the category with its patented two-piece system: a removable rug cover that attaches to a nonslip pad.\nI’m a particular fan of Ruggable in the kitchen, where spills and stains are unavoidable. I have the Pamir Ivory Multicolour Flatwoven Rug under my dishwasher, sink, and stove, and I love everything about it: the design adds some personality to my kitchen; it keeps my feet cozy while I’m cooking or doing dishes; and cleaning is painless. I only have one Ruggable rug in my kitchen, but honestly I should probably have one in every room, especially because my two cats have a habit of puking on the coziest rugs they can find.\nRuggable has an enormous selection of styles, colors, and patterns, so there’s a rug for just about every room and aesthetic. My only real complaints are the occasional edge curling and the relatively pricey tag. Neither is a dealbreaker, especially when Ruggable is on sale. And if you’ve been eyeing one for a while, our Ruggable discount code or a Ruggable coupon make the splurge a little easier to justify.\nScore a High-Value Ruggable Coupon on Sale Styles and Everyday Room Refreshes\nIf you can’t find a Ruggable promo code that fits your needs, Ruggable features a dedicated sale section that offers a rotating selection of discounted rugs and runners, with savings of up to 30% off. Some items in the sale are final sale, while others may still be eligible for Ruggable’s standard return policy, so be sure to check the fine print.\nThe selection is impressively diverse, showcasing patterns that range from geometric and patchwork to abstract designs. You'll also find collaborations, such as designs from Jonathan Adler, and styles that span modern, bohemian, and Persian aesthetics. There are various pile heights to choose from, and rugs suitable for nearly every space, including outdoor areas.\nKeep an eye out for seasonal inventory clearance sales, where retired designs are marked down to their lowest prices of the year, with no Ruggable coupon code needed. In the past, I’ve noticed bestsellers included in these sales, including the Bodin Ink Blue Outdoor Rug, the Glen Plaid Rug, and the Serenata Terracotta Rug. If you're in the market for a Ruggable, this page should be your first stop.\nSave up to 15% With a Ruggable Discount Code for First Orders, Referrals, and More\nIf you’re new to Ruggable, you can sign up for email or SMS updates to get a Ruggable discount code for 10% off your first order. You’ll receive a personalized Ruggable promo code that expires 21 days after you sign up, so don’t waste it. Some exclusions apply, so be sure to read the terms and conditions.\nThere’s another Ruggable discount waiting after your order arrives, too. Once you’ve had a chance to try out your new rug, keep an eye on your inbox for a feedback questionnaire. Submit the review to receive another Ruggable promo code for 15% off your next order.\nBuy Two Items, Get 15% Off With This Ruggable Coupon\nFor a limited time, Ruggable is offering 15% off your entire order when you purchase at least two eligible items. Just use the Ruggable promo code BUY2GET15 at checkout. The Ruggable discount includes, but is not limited to rugs, pillows, pet beds, and more. It doesn’t, however, include gift cards, swatches, or a spot cleaner.\nBuy 3+ Ruggable Items for a 20% Discount on Pillows\nIf you’re shopping for decorative pillows, Ruggable is offering 20% off when you buy three or more pillows. There’s no Ruggable promo code to enter; the discount is automatically applied at checkout once you’ve added at least three pillows to your cart.\nRuggable Trade Discounts and Spill Club Points for Large Decor Projects\nIf you’re an interior designer, architect, or trade professional, Ruggable’s Design Trade Program offers a handful of perks beyond the standard Ruggable discount. You’ll need to complete a short application for verification, and a member of Ruggable’s team will email you within a few business days to confirm your eligibility.\nOnce approved, trade members get an exclusive Ruggable online discount, free sample swatches, no order minimums or maximums, and tax-exempt purchasing options. Discounts are subject to change, but at the time of writing, trade members get 20% off single-item purchases and 25% off orders of three or more eligible items. You’ll also have access to dedicated sales support for sourcing, project questions, and complex orders.\nThe Design Trade Program also doubles as a sort of loyalty program through Ruggable’s Spill Points, which can be redeemed for future discount vouchers. You earn points through purchases and bonuses, including 100 points for your birthday and 25 points for linking your phone number for text alerts.\nUnlock Free Standard Shipping on Ruggable Orders in the U.S. and Canada\nOne of my favorite things about shopping at Ruggable is that standard shipping is free within the contiguous US, with no minimum purchase required. Orders are shipped via FedEx, and the free shipping is automatically applied at checkout, so there’s no promo code to worry about.\nFree shipping doesn’t apply to orders shipped to Alaska, Hawaii, or US territories, and handling fees still apply. Check out Ruggable’s shipping policy for the full details.\nStay Ahead of New Ruggable Coupon & Deal Drops\nRuggable runs plenty of sales beyond the usual Black Friday and Cyber Monday events, including frequent clearance drops. The easiest way to keep tabs on them is to bookmark Ruggable’s discount page and check back regularly.\nIt’s also worth following Ruggable on social media, including Instagram, Pinterest, and Facebook (yes, it’s still around), where the brand often previews designer collections and shares exclusive Ruggable coupon codes for followers. And if you really don’t want to miss a deal, sign up for Ruggable’s newsletter for early access to holiday sales. That way, you can shop before the best styles sell out.\nHow to Fix a Ruggable Discount Code That’s Not Working\nIf your Ruggable discount code isn’t working, don’t panic just yet. There are a few easy troubleshooting steps to try before giving up on the deal.\nFirst, double-check the code for typos. If you’re copying and pasting it, make sure there aren’t any extra spaces at the beginning or end that can trigger an error. Next, confirm that the promotion hasn’t expired. Flash sales and weekend promotions can end at specific times, sometimes based on Eastern or Pacific time.\nAlso, remember that Ruggable generally allows only one promotional code per order. So, if you’re trying to stack a first-order discount with a sitewide sale, for example, the system will only apply the higher-value offer. Finally, check the promotion’s exclusions. Some Ruggable promo codes are limited to specific collections or purchase requirements, so make sure everything in your cart qualifies.",
