        "full_content": "Whether you're worried about the open network at your local coffee shop or want to get around geo-restrictions when you're traveling, NordVPN can help. A virtual private network (VPN) is like a protective tunnel, keeping your data safe from prying eyes. VPNs aren’t perfect protection (you need to trust your VPN provider), but they’re always going to be better than nothing when you’re using a public hotspot. They also make it easy to continue to watch your favorite shows even when you’re on vacation. If you want to learn more about how to protect yourself online, see our guide to The Best VPNs.\nSave 75% With this NordVPN Coupon + 3 Extra Months\nNordVPN’s most popular tier is the Complete plan, which is currently 75% off and includes three extra months for free when you buy right now. At just $4.49 per month (along with the three months free), it’s only $121 for the first 27 months. With the Complete NordVPN plan, you’ll get a secure, fast VPN, monitoring of your email, phone, credit card, and national ID/SSN to make sure there’s no external threats, protection against scam calls, anti-malware software, browsing protection, an ad blocker, a password manager, 1 TB cloud storage, and a 30-day money-back guarantee to ensure this is the right plan for you.\nGet 77% Off Plans With Exclusive NordVPN Discount Code\nNordVPN is pretty much always having a sale, but some of the deals are better than others and this is one of the best we’ve seen. Right now, NordVPN is offering 77% off its regular price, plus an Amazon gift card valued up to $50 when you sign up for a 2-year Prime plan. It's valid for the first 15 months of the subscription, with threat protection, high-speed VPN, and more. Follow the link above and use our exclusive coupon code at checkout to get the deal.\nSpecial Offer: 74% Off With an Amazon Gift Card\nRight now, you can get up to 74% off a NordVPN plan, plus get an Amazon gift card for free! Plus, when you get NordVPN, you’ll have a 30-day money-back guarantee if you realize the service isn’t for you. To get the Amazon gift card reward, you just need to buy any of the NordVPN 2-year Plus, Complete, or Prime plans; and the bigger the plan you purchase, the bigger the reward you’ll receive. Once bought, you’ll get an email sent to your inbox with all the details, then you’ll claim your gift card, and need to remain a NordVPN subscriber for 31 days. Then, your Amazon Gift card will be mailed 31-50 days after purchase.\nSave More With a NordVPN Subscription Plan\nThe two-year Plus plan is the most popular, and our recommendation. For a limited time, their more comprehensive Prime 2-year subscriptions qualify for up to 77% off, and you’ll receive 3 free months with select 2-year plans, starting with the Plus option.\nNordVPN offers different plans for different needs, including one-year and one-month plans. Plans’ pricing varies greatly, with short-term, one-month plans starting at $13. The plans get cheaper the longer you commit to a plan, to reward loyal VPN customers. One-year plans start at $5 and go to $10, depending on which package you choose. Two-year plans are even cheaper, starting at $3 and going up to $7 for the top-tier plans with all of the bells and whistles. It makes a lot more sense to invest in a longer protection plan to keep your information and devices safe, for less.\nHow Do I Buy A NordVPN Subscription Plan?\nIf NordVPN is the right service for you, the best way is to order straight from their website because it’s the cheapest price and you’ll get all of the perks from buying directly from the brand. Once you’ve picked the best service for you, click “Continue to Payment.” After, all you need to do is input your email address, select your payment method, and if you’ve nabbed a NordVPN promo code from WIRED, input that in the box at payment and watch the price slash.\nScore a NordVPN Discount Code for 15% Off\nThe coupons aren’t the only deals to be had. You can wait for a sale (see above) or if you qualify, there are discounts for students, graduates, teachers, healthcare, military, and first responders. Once verified with Student Beans, you can unlock a NordVPN promo code for 15% off plans.\nNordVPN Friend Referral Discount\nIf you like NordVPN, you can save yourself even more with the refer-a-friend promotion. You’ll receive 3 months free for every friend who buys NordVPN through your referral link. The more friends you refer, the more rewards you’ll earn. Your friends will get the same deal you did, 3 extra months if they choose the 1- or 2-year plans or 1 free month if they opt for the monthly plan.\nCan You Get a NordVPN Free Trial?\nCurious about NordVPN services but don’t want to make the jump? You’re in luck. NordVPN offers a 30-day free trial. To try it out, you’ll need to pick the plan that’s right for you, and download the NordVPN app on your device. NordVPN also has a 3-day free trial on Android. And you can try NordVPN risk free for a month: you’ll need to pay for a subscription up front, but if NordVPN isn’t the right fit, you can request a refund within 30 days of your date of purchase.\nGet the latest NordVPN Pricing\nNordVPN has four tiers of plans fit for every type of need. Each gets you a secure VPN, but with each level you’ll get even more perks, like an ad tracker and blocker and 1 TB of Cloud storage. Right now, you can get up to 77% off each plan, including three months free. Check out which plan (and price) is the best fit for you here.\nHow Can You Get NordVPN for iPhone?\nLucky for you, it’s easier than ever to get NordVPN for iPhone. Having a VPN (virtual private network) on your iPhone or iPad helps to keep your internet connection secure and protects your data. All you need to do is set up a VPN app on your iOS device, then connect to a VPN server. Once you do that, it encrypts all the data your device sends and receives, making it even more secure. Simply download, sign up to create a new account or click “Log in” if you already have one, connect, and tap “Secure my connection” for instant VPN protection.\nWhat Is NordVPN Meshnet?\nThe NordVPN Meshnet allows users to safely access their devices, no matter where they are. You’ll need to set up Meshnet, but once it’s up and running, it functions like a secure local area network (LAN) by connecting the devices directly. Meshnet ensures high speed, low latency, and advanced security for everything from file sharing, work collaboration, and multi-player gaming.\nPrevent Cyber Identity Theft with NordVPN\nWorried about someone using your name to take out loans and create accounts? NordVPN has your back. You can use NordProtect to get instant alerts so you can act fast and protect your identity against everything that the wild, wild west of the internet throws your way. You’ll also get credit monitoring, where you’ll receive fast security warnings about suspicious credit activity happening under your name, so you can stop fraud before it becomes dangerous. Plus, there’s 24/7 dark web monitoring, where you’ll receive instant alerts about any email address, SSN, and phone number leaks.\nCan I Get a Business VPN With NordVPN?\nNordVPN Business is the ideal VPN service to protect your business. This service simplifies secure access to your company’s network, including protecting cloud environments and internal assets. Plus, with a 14-day money-back guarantee, testing is hassle-free so you can determine if it’s the right service to protect you (and your business).",
