        "full_content": "Dua Lipa’s Funmaxxing Via Constant Vacationing Makes Me Have Hope as the World Around Me Burns\nBy Sari Moon\nDua Lipa spent Wednesday on a yacht off Ibiza with her brother Gjin and sister Rina, swimming, sunbathing, and turning the deck into a family-run photo shoot. Dua posed in a leopard-print triangle bikini: very chic, very hot.\nShe held a civil ceremony with Callum Turner in London in late May, followed it with a larger celebration in Sicily, honeymooned on the Amalfi Coast, hung out in NYC for a bit, then went to Portofino for her friend Ella’s wedding at, like, the best hotel in the world, and has now arrived in Ibiza to stage bikini shoots with her siblings.\nThe world is bleak and will end in a few years, and I don’t think that if an asteroid starts heading toward Earth, the team from Armageddon will be there to save us. But also, like, it probably won’t end because of an asteroid, so that won’t matter. Anyway, at least in these final days, we can observe Dua Lipa having so much fun, all the time.\nI wonder if I have cyclospora…\nThanks for reading Thought Catalog. Show us some love on Facebook, and discover more on our website.",
