        "title": "“I Wouldn’t Care If Kim Hooked Up With Tristan,” Khloé Kardashian Says of Her Ex, “The Baton Is Passed.”",
        "link": "https://thoughtcatalog.com/xstockton/2026/08/i-wouldnt-care-if-kim-hooked-up-with-tristan-khloe-kardashian-says-of-her-ex-the-baton-is-passed/",
        "source": "Thought Catalog",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.248317+00:00",
        "image": "https://thoughtcatalog.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/i-wouldn-t-care-if-kim-hooked-up-with-tristan-khloe-kardashian-says-of-her-ex-th.jpg?w=1536&h=768&crop=1",
        "full_content": "“I Wouldn’t Care If Kim Hooked Up With Tristan,” Khloé Kardashian Says of Her Ex, “The Baton Is Passed.”\nKhloé Kardashian says her split from Tristan Thompson is so final she’d hand him off with her blessing — even to her sister.\nThe moment plays out on The Girls, Kardashian’s new Hulu series built around six of her closest friends. Rather than a traditional docuseries about her own life, the show hands the spotlight to the women in her circle, and the group’s candid conversations quickly become its engine.\nOn the first episode, Olivia Pierson describes her unease over a blind date that turned out to be with Yris Palmer’s ex-husband, saying her “first thought” was, “[That’s] Yris’ ex. I don’t go there.” Khadijah Haqq argued it was fine because Palmer set up the date, so Pierson had “permission to go there.”\nThat’s when Khloé, 42, offered her own example to make the point. When Malika Haqq called the idea of Kim and Tristan “a little gross,” Khloé quickly walked it back: “Well, I’m not saying that actually.” What she meant, she explained, was that the chapter is closed — and that her only real wish for Thompson now is happiness. “I have love and respect and you have a great relationship. I wanna see you happy, so I want you with the best person that I could think of.”\nKhloé dated Thompson on and off from 2016 to 2022 and shares daughter True, 8, and son Tatum, 4, with him. The relationship ended for good in January 2022 after she learned he’d fathered a child with another woman while they were together — a breach that played out publicly and cemented the split she now describes as beyond revisiting.\nDating a family member’s ex has precedent in the Kardashian family. Kourtney is married to Travis Barker, who first professed his lust for Kourtney’s younger sister Kim in his 2015 memoir, saying he couldn’t keep his eyes off her. Kim is currently dating Lewis Hamilton, who was rumored to be dating Kendall back in 2015. A 2019 scandal also saw Kylie Jenner’s longtime best friend, Jordyn Woods, making out with Tristan Thompson at a party. At the time, he was Khloé’s boyfriend and they already had a kid together. Khloé gave him another chance and they had son Tatum together in 2022 before calling it quits.\nKhloé shrugging off the idea of Kim and Tristan may sound hypocritical given the Jordyn Woods of it all, but the difference is Tristan is now an ex, not a committed boyfriend she trusts to stay faithful.\nAll six episodes of The Girls are now streaming on Hulu.\nThank you for reading. Catch all of Thought Catalog’s latest on Facebook and our website.",
        "content": "“I Wouldn’t Care If Kim Hooked Up With Tristan,” Khloé Kardashian Says of Her Ex, “The Baton Is Passed.”\nKhloé Kardashian says her split from Tristan Thompson is so final she’d hand him off with her blessing — even to her sister.\nThe moment plays out on The Girls, Kardashian’s new Hulu series built around six of her closest friends. Rather than a traditional docuseries about her own life, the show...",
