        "title": "Trump waives ‘out-of-quota’ beef tariffs for 90 days to lower prices",
        "link": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/21/trump-waives-out-of-quota-beef-tariffs-for-90-days-to-lower-prices?traffic_source=rss",
        "source": "Al Jazeera – Breaking News, World News and Video from Al Jazeera",
