        "title": "Serbian president visits Expo Center project built by Chinese company",
        "link": "https://news.cgtn.com/news/2026-08-15/Serbian-president-visits-Expo-Center-project-built-by-Chinese-company-1PCQnrJkkmc/p.html?UTM_Source=cgtn&UTM_Medium=rss&UTM_Campaign=China",
