        "title": "Indecently cool FPS platformer Cicadamata\" is out now - please get yourself down that rabbit hole",
        "link": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/indecently-cool-fps-platformer-cicadamata-is-out-now-please-get-yourself-down-that-rabbit-hole",
        "source": "Rock Paper Shotgun Latest Articles Feed",
