        "title": "Tails of Iron 2: Blood & Brine – Free Expansion",
        "link": "https://blog.playstation.com/2026/08/21/tails-of-iron-2-blood-brine-free-expansion/",
        "source": "PlayStation.Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247855+00:00",
