        "title": "Tomb Raider I-III Remastered Update Adds Three New Features, Includes 60fps In Classic Graphics Mode",
        "link": "https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/08/tomb-raider-i-iii-remastered-update-adds-three-new-features-includes-60fps-in-classic-graphics-mode",
        "source": "Nintendo Life | Latest Updates",
