        "title": "‘The Yogurt Shop Murders’ Crew Thought Their Journey Was Done Until There Was a Big Break in the Case: ‘We Have to Rally Now’",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/tv/focus/yogurt-shop-murders-break-case-1236840276/",
        "source": "Variety",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247718+00:00",
