        "title": "How Hollywood’s Veterans Are Chasing Emmy History: Sally Field, Harrison Ford, Martin Short and More",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/tv/awards/harrison-ford-sally-field-emmys-2026-oldest-winner-history-1236831709/",
        "source": "Variety",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
