        "title": "Quality Control Co-Founder Pierre “P” Thomas Hospitalized Following Heart Attack",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/music/music-news/quality-control-co-founder-pierre-p-thomas-hospitalized-1236678691/",
