        "title": "HBO Max’s Jimmy Olsen & Gorilla Grodd ‘Superman’ Spinoff Series Gets Series Order & Title, Sets Cast",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/hbo-max-jimmy-olsen-people-v-gorilla-grodd-series-cast-1237047545/",
        "source": "Deadline",
