        "title": "Why Talk Show Legend Merrill Markoe Felt Right At Home On ‘Hacks’ After Years Of Real-Life Writing For ‘Letterman’ – Guest Column",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/hacks-merrill-markoe-letterman-interview-1237047626/",
        "source": "Deadline",
