        "title": "The cheapest model on my plan loses every benchmark. It still beats models charging 14x more.",
        "link": "https://dev.to/dev_michael/the-cheapest-model-on-my-plan-loses-every-benchmark-it-still-beats-models-charging-14x-more-2po8",
        "source": "DEV Community",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247548+00:00",
