    {
        "title": "Get Ready For the Powerful CSS border-shape Property!",
        "link": "https://css-tricks.com/get-ready-for-the-powerful-css-border-shape-property/",
        "source": "CSS-Tricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247528+00:00",
=======
