    {
        "title": "Using and Styling the Dialog Element",
        "link": "https://css-tricks.com/using-and-styling-the-dialog-element/",
        "source": "CSS-Tricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247518+00:00",
=======
