    {
        "title": "Blocked aria-hidden: The Warning is Right, and Every Fix You’ve Found is Wrong",
        "link": "https://css-tricks.com/blocked-aria-hidden-fix/",
        "source": "CSS-Tricks",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.247507+00:00",
=======
