        "title": "Evo Continuous Offensive Security Is Here Pentesting Grade Coverage For The 350 Days A Year You Aren't Testing",
        "link": "https://snyk.io/blog/evo-continuous-offensive-security/",
        "source": "Blog RSS Feed | Snyk",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.246669+00:00",
=======
