        "image": "https://wpblogassets.paytm.com/paytmblog/uploads/2026/08/total-balance-1.png",
        "full_content": "Keeping track of your money can get confusing, especially when you have multiple bank accounts.\nYou may use one bank account to receive your salary, another for everyday expenses, and a different one for your Paytm UPI payments. When your money is spread across multiple bank accounts, checking each balance separately can make it harder to get a complete picture of your finances.\nThat is where Paytm Total Balance comes in.\nWith Paytm Total Balance, you can view your bank account balances in one place. Instead of opening multiple banking apps or checking each account individually, you can view the balances of your linked bank accounts together on Paytm.\nChecking Multiple Bank Accounts Just Got Easier\nWe all know the feeling.\nYou check the balance in one bank account and think, “Okay, not bad.” Then you remember there is money in another account too. Maybe you use one account for your salary, another for everyday expenses, and another for your Paytm UPI payments.\nBefore you know it, you are switching between accounts and doing mental maths just to figure out how much money you have across them.\nWith Paytm Total Balance, you can view your bank account balances together in one place. This means you do not have to check every bank account individually when you want a quick overview of your balances.\nA Simpler Way to View Your Bank Account Balances\nHaving multiple bank accounts can help you manage different parts of your finances. One account might be for salary, another for daily expenses, and another could be the one you use most often for Paytm UPI payments.\nBut when you want to know how much money you have across your accounts, checking every balance separately can take time.\nWith Paytm Total Balance, you can view your bank account balances across your linked accounts in one place. Whether you are planning your monthly expenses, checking your available balance before making plans, or simply want a quick overview, you can see your linked bank account balances without jumping between multiple banking apps.\nYour Bank Account Balances, All in One Place\nManaging your money does not always mean creating spreadsheets or doing calculations. Sometimes, you simply need an easier way to view your bank account balances.\nPaytm Total Balance gives you a consolidated view of the balances across your linked bank accounts, making it easier to understand where your money stands.\nSo, if you have multiple bank accounts, open the Paytm app and use Paytm Total Balance to view your bank account balances in one place.\nNo switching between banking apps. No checking every account one by one. Just one place to view your bank account balances.",
