        "title": "GPT-5.6 now available in Microsoft Foundry",
        "link": "https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/gpt-5-6-now-available-in-microsoft-foundry/",
        "source": "Microsoft Azure Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
