        "title": "Qodana Expands Security Analysis with OpenGrep Rules, and More",
        "link": "https://blog.jetbrains.com/qodana/2026/08/opengrep-inspections/",
        "source": "The JetBrains Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.245935+00:00",
