        "title": "PyCharm for AI-assisted Django Workflows",
        "link": "https://blog.jetbrains.com/pycharm/2026/08/pycharm-for-ai-assisted-django-workflows/",
        "source": "The JetBrains Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
