        "title": "Thinking of ACE? We Can Do It with Fewer Tokens",
        "link": "https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/altk-evolve-sldd",
        "source": "Hugging Face - Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.245875+00:00",
