ere you need some design concepts – like creating a flyer – you can ask Canva to show you some template options.\nWant to build the perfect soundtrack for your next party? You can use AI Mode to curate a playlist, instantly save it to YouTube Music and press play to start the celebration.\nHead over to AI Mode in Search to try the new connected apps today. We're working with a range of partners and look forward to launching with more apps soon.\nGet the latest news from Google in your inbox\nSign up for our newsletters with product updates, event information, special offers, and more.\nDone. Just one step more.\nCheck your inbox to confirm your subscription.\nYou can also subscribe with a different email address.\nYour information will be used in accordance with Google's privacy policy. You may opt out at any time.",
