        "title": "Avoid the massive end-to-end tax of default full history clones",
        "link": "https://about.gitlab.com/blog/git-clone-override-policy/",
        "source": "GitLab",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.245707+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:51:27.470840+00:00",
