        "title": "Teaching Coding Agents to Check Their VCL with Fastly Fiddle",
        "link": "https://www.fastly.com/blog/teaching-coding-agents-to-check-their-vcl-with-fastly-fiddle/",
        "source": "Fastly Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.245616+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:51:27.470750+00:00",
