        "image": "https://blog.coursera.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/coursera_320X320.png",
        "full_content": "Today, Google is expanding its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with their newest course on vibe coding that helps learners move from AI users to AI builders.\nFor decades, building software required learning to code. But now, with vibe coding, AI is making it possible for professionals across industries to build applications that automate everyday work using natural language instead of traditional programming. As AI lowers barriers to software creation, success depends less on the ability to write code and more on knowing how to think through problems, iterate on solutions, and build applications people can trust.\nDesigned and taught by experts at Google, this new course teaches a practical framework for planning, building, debugging, and deploying AI-powered applications using Google AI Studio, Gemini, and Gemini Canvas.\nThis course teaches concepts beyond one-click code generation, emphasizing the iterative process software developers use every day. Learners practice identifying the right opportunities for automation, transforming ideas into working prototypes, troubleshooting errors, and deploying secure applications that solve real workplace challenges. Along the way, they’ll gain hands-on experience with Google’s latest AI tools while building skills that transfer across AI development environments.\nLearners will build multiple AI-powered applications while learning how to:\n- Plan and architect applications before writing prompts\n- Debug and refine apps using Google AI Studio\n- Deploy secure applications that protect organizational information\n- Apply a reusable framework for building AI-powered solutions that can be adapted to future projects\nThe new course builds on the successful Google AI Professional Certificate, which has already helped more than one million learners deepen the AI skills they use every day while preparing them for the next generation of work. It also keeps the certificate current as AI capabilities continue to evolve, giving learners access to Google’s latest tools and best practices.\nWe’re proud to continue our partnership with Google to help learners build practical AI skills that translate directly into workplace impact and make app creation accessible to millions of professionals.\nLearn to build with AI today\nSign up for Coursera Plus to access the Google AI Professional Certificate and the new\nAI for App Deployment course.",
