        "title": "Exclusive: A leader in Venezuela’s National Assembly engages ‘money doctor’ Steve Hanke for a dose of dollarization medicine in a nation sick from hyperinflation",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/venezuela-steve-hanke-hyperinflation-dollarization-money-doctor/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
