        "title": "Forget RTO: Fully remote workers report the highest well-being—and are less likely to quit, new study of 7,700 employees finds",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/work-from-home-major-study-remote-workers-well-being-less-likely-to-quit-despite-ceos-like-musk-dimon-push-rto/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
