        "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/opinion/columns/tintin-or-asterix-two-ways-of-seeing-the-world-through-comic-book-genius-126082101502_1.html",
        "source": "Latest News",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244732+00:00",
