        "title": "Makkah Pact and the shifting equations in West Asia",
        "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/opinion/columns/makkah-pact-and-the-shifting-equations-in-west-asia-126082101526_1.html",
        "source": "Latest News",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244724+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:51:27.469810+00:00",
