        "title": "Sensex CAS manipulation: Thin liquidity exposes vulnerability; what's ahead?",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/markets/stocks/story/sensex-cas-manipulation-thin-liquidity-exposes-vulnerability-whats-ahead-550597-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
        "source": "Business News India: Latest Business News Today, Share Market, Economy",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244672+00:00",
