        "title": "1.1 billion barrels gone: IMF warns that global oil market is running out of safety cushions",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/world/story/over-1-billion-barrels-gone-imf-warns-that-global-oil-market-is-running-out-of-safety-cushions-550685-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
        "source": "Business News India: Latest Business News Today, Share Market, Economy",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244635+00:00",
