        "title": "Scaling up India's manufacturing ambitions",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/magazine/cover-story/story/scaling-up-indias-manufacturing-ambitions-550544-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
        "source": "Business News India: Latest Business News Today, Share Market, Economy",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244628+00:00",
