    {
        "title": "AI won’t fix enterprise complexity. Rewiring will",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/tiaa-accenture-rewire-broken-country-ai-adoption/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
