        "title": "IMD forecasts widespread rain across central, northeast India; monsoon activity to stay subdued over peninsular region",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/imd-forecasts-widespread-rain-across-central-northeast-india-monsoon-activity-to-stay-subdued-over-peninsular-region-11787312212714.html",
        "source": "mint - news",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244076+00:00",
