        "title": "CDSCO orders action against unapproved enclomiphene drugs",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/cdsco-orders-action-against-unapproved-enclomiphene-drugs-11787310662347.html",
        "source": "mint - news",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
