        "title": "Delhi Police registers FIR over alleged pellet gun use during CJP protest after Rahul Gandhi’s sit-in",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/delhi-police-registers-fir-in-pellet-guns-case-during-cjp-protest-rahul-gandhis-sit-in-protest-ends-11787317244875.html",
        "source": "mint - news",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T20:40:18.244069+00:00",
