    {
        "title": "Why are sugar prices rising? Centre rejects ethanol link, cites five reasons behind surge",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/why-are-sugar-prices-rising-centre-rejects-ethanol-link-cites-five-reasons-behind-surge-11787321160622.html",
