    {
        "title": "‘Victory for journalism’: Prince Harry ordered to pay £9.54 million as Daily Mail lawsuit fails",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/victory-for-journalism-prince-harry-ordered-to-pay-9-54-million-as-daily-mail-lawsuit-fails-11787323178499.html",
